#Flow control statements:
The purpose of flow control statements is to perform certain operation at once only(if x:test condition is True or y:condition False)
or to perform repeatedly tasks if condition is not become False.
There are three types of Flow control statements
1)Conditional statements:that conditions perform certain operation at once only
2)Looping statements:that condition is perform certain operation repeatedly if condition becomes False
3)Transfer Flow statements
