==>1}Conditional Statements:The purpose of conditional statements is to perform operation at once only
(test condition X is True or test condition Y is False)
if user want define test condition later so that time  'pass' keyword is use , that ignore the condition
There are 4 Types of test conditions are
a)simple if
b)if else condition
c)if elif else condition
d)match case condition


==>2}Looping Statements: The purpose of Looping Statements is to Repeat operation for finite time if the the condition is False
There are 2 types of Looping Statements are there
a)while / while_else loop
b)for  / for_else loop

==>3}Transfer Flow Statements:The purpose of transfer flow statement is to control execution block of statement define in conditions
and loops or define indentation block
There are 4 types of transfer flow statement
a)break(this statement is use only in inside the loop)
b)continue (is outdated it use rarely)
c)pass (this statement is use currently on continue place)
d)return(this statement use in user defined function)